e":"0"}},"recommendations":{"total":159},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"2 Apr, 2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cElroy and the Aliens captures all the heart, charm and inventiveness of the golden age of point-and-click adventure games.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 CGMagazine<br><br>\u201cElroy and the Aliens is a charismatic game, filled with hope, love and camaraderie. Serious and comedic themes combine in a fascinating narrative complemented by colorful, whimsical graphics. I recommend Elroy and the Aliens to all adventurers.\u201d<br>4.5/5 \u2013 Adventure Gamers<br><br>\u201cDon\u2019t let its delightfully cartoonish appearance fool you: Elroy and the Aliens is a wonderfully heartfelt point-and-click journey across time and space, about family connections and the lengths we\u2019ll go to reunite with our loved ones.\u201d<br>85% \u2013 Adventure Game Hotspot<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/ss_2e90f171743bb5a0316df82cbfeea6de6d5e7b57.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744378898","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/ss_2e90f171743bb5a0316df82cbfeea6de6d5e7b57.600x338.jpg?t=1744378898"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/ss_d6a67ee118943e15645b484d05281f3221de1562.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744378898","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/ss_d6a67ee118943e15645b484d05281f3221de1562.600x338.jpg?t=1744378898"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/ss_fff7ed947768358f989868ba07994b1a166b7f73.1920x1080.jpg?t=1744378898","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/ss_fff7ed947768358f989868ba07994b1a166b7f73.600x338.jpg?t=1744378898"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1082190/s